"""
=================================================HELP=MESSAGE===========================================================

Configuration reset can be used when module needs to be moved to another site.

    configurationreset [-waitforreset]
        [-ne address] [-ipfile file] [-pw username:password,...]
        [-attempts number] [-concurrent number] [-connectout seconds]
        [-debug] [-keepconn seconds] [-nolog] [-nolog] [-nosummary]
        [-outdir directory] [-output file] [-timeout seconds] [-verbose]

    -ne           Single IP address of one site.
    -ipfile       File containing several IP addresses.
    -pw           Sets of credentials for the sites.
    -waitforreset Wait BTS to reset, reconnect after reset finished.
    -attempts     Maximum number of connection attempts (3 by default).
    -concurrent   Maximum number of concurrent connections (10 by default).
    -connectout   Timeout for connection (60 seconds by default).
    -debug        Runs the tool in debug mode. Tool behaviour varies.
    -keepconn     Keep tool connected for a number of seconds after operation.
    -nolog        Prevents the tool from creating log file.
    -nosummary    Prevents the tool from creating summary file.
    -outdir       Redirects all output files to a specific directory.
    -output       Saves console output also to given file.
    -timeout      General timeout for operations (60 seconds by default).
    -verbose      Generate more detailed console output.

Single IP address or address file must be given.

"""
